# Second class change on a subclass (SecondClassChange): a level 76 human Gladiator plays its
# level 50 Sorcerer subclass and asks Grand Master Hannavalt about its class: the master offers
# nothing while a subclass is played, so the dialog is the no-quest page, where the base class
# would hear it has already made its second change. After a relog the character still plays the
# subclass, so Hannavalt still answers the no-quest page. Expectations are the reference trace's
# (SecondClassChange.onTalk).
trace internal/gameserver/script/testdata/oracle/scenarios/second_class_change_subclass.golden
character Fighter 76
class 2
subclass 12 50
script script.feature.SecondClassChange
page villagemaster/30109.htm
page script/feature/SecondClassChange/
npc hannavalt 30109 VillageMasterFighter 10 0 0

action hannavalt
action hannavalt
  S ActionFailed
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=hannavalt item=0 page=villagemaster/30109.htm
  S ActionFailed
bypass npc_{hannavalt}_Quest SecondClassChange
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=hannavalt item=0 html="<html><body>You are either not on a quest that involves this NPC, or you don't meet this NPC's minimum quest requirements.</body></html>"
  S ActionFailed
  S ActionFailed
relog
action hannavalt
action hannavalt
  S ActionFailed
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=hannavalt item=0 page=villagemaster/30109.htm
  S ActionFailed
bypass npc_{hannavalt}_Quest SecondClassChange
  S NpcHtmlMessage obj=hannavalt item=0 html="<html><body>You are either not on a quest that involves this NPC, or you don't meet this NPC's minimum quest requirements.</body></html>"
  S ActionFailed
  S ActionFailed
